> I'm wondering if I should calculate the product indicators once and create the bootstrap draws from that, or if I should recalculate the product indicators for each bootstrap draw.

You bootstrap the entire row of data, so each person's products would be the same in each bootstrap sample.  So you can just calculate them prior to bootstrapping.

