> variable. The model is as follows.
>
> m ~ a*x1
>
> y ~ c*x1 + x2 + b*m + x2:m
>
> Since m is an ordinal variable,  we cannot create this x2:m interaction.
> Additionally, in y ~ x1 + x2 + b*m + x2:m, I would like to specify a “b”
> path, but I am unsure whether this is the right way.
>
> Thanks,
>
> Clare McCann
