Without going too deeply into the problem .... It should be possible to specify the model, then apply lavaanify and change the resulting data frame at the appropriate place, i.e. add the label at the right place. After that you should be able to fit the model with the label. It should also be possible to write a function that simplifies or generalizes the process.

